hafleet — Home Assistant fleet manager

  Web UI:        http://<container-ip>:8080
  Create admin:  hafleet-admin create admin
  Settings:      /etc/hafleet/hafleet.env  (then: rc-service hafleet restart)
  Logs:          tail -f /var/log/hafleet.log
  Data:          /var/lib/hafleet  (back up together with /etc/hafleet/secret.key)

